  "details": "Not sure if this is even possible on vrc's end but nothing is more infuriating while using full body, then your tracking randomly deciding to start flying all over the place/shoot away from its intended spot randomly, sometimes it happens even though everything in your playspace is setup perfectly, it would be great if there was some way for the tracker to be locked in place if its detected that its begun to fly away, that way you wouldn't have cases where your just laying down and your tracking somehow starts disconnecting and next thing you know your hip is flying towards someones face then down into the floor",
